WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:18.745
"Hmm," Mrs. Tiggywinkle thought.

2
00:00:18.746 --> 00:00:24.726
She looked at Simpkin.

3
00:00:24.727 --> 00:00:28.352
"We cannot finish the coat," she said.

4
00:00:28.353 --> 00:00:32.198
"So I will make a cake."

5
00:00:32.199 --> 00:00:36.415
"A cake?" Simpkin cried.

6
00:00:36.416 --> 00:00:39.729
He rubbed his belly.

7
00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:42.721
"Oh," Mrs. Tiggywinkle said.

8
00:00:42.722 --> 00:00:45.249
She made a sad face.

9
00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:47.567
"We have no flour.

10
00:00:47.568 --> 00:00:56.800
And the shop is closed today."

11
00:00:56.801 --> 00:01:02.722
Mopsy sighed. "No cake and no buttons."

12
00:01:02.723 --> 00:01:05.696
Suddenly Simpkin jumped up.

13
00:01:05.697 --> 00:01:09.059
"The shop is open!" he cried.

14
00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:17.112
"What?" Mrs. Tiggywinkle said.

15
00:01:17.113 --> 00:01:22.881
"Here." Simpkin held out three gold buttons.

16
00:01:22.882 --> 00:01:25.344
"I was mad at the tailor.

17
00:01:25.345 --> 00:01:27.774
He ate my lunch!"

18
00:01:27.775 --> 00:01:31.001
Mrs. Tiggywinkle patted Simpkin.

19
00:01:31.002 --> 00:01:34.810
"It is hard to be hungry."

20
00:01:34.811 --> 00:01:39.033
Mrs. Tiggywinkle gave the buttons to the bunnies.

21
00:01:39.034 --> 00:01:41.932
Then she looked at Simpkin.

22
00:01:41.933 --> 00:01:44.876
"Go to the shop for some flour.

23
00:01:44.877 --> 00:01:57.972
We will sew and bake."

24
00:01:57.973 --> 00:02:01.705
Soon the coat was ready.

25
00:02:01.706 --> 00:02:08.236
"Beautiful!" Mrs. Tiggywinkle said.

26
00:02:08.237 --> 00:02:11.266
Simpkin stared at the cake.

27
00:02:11.267 --> 00:02:16.824
"Beautiful!" he said.

28
00:02:16.825 --> 00:02:22.451
The tailor climbed out of bed.

29
00:02:22.452 --> 00:02:26.621
On the coat, three gold buttons shined.

30
00:02:26.622 --> 00:02:29.055
"Beautiful!" he said.

31
00:02:29.056 --> 00:02:52.367
"Thank you, bunnies!"
